<title>USA: Endogen hires financial chief.</title>
<headline>Endogen hires financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Endogen Inc said Monday Avery &quot;Chip&quot; Catlin had joined the company as vice president-finance, treasurer and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Catlin's corporate finance career spans more than 20 years. Prior to joining Endogen, he spent four years at Repligen Corp, serving the last two years as CFO.</p>
<p>Previously, a spokeswoman said, Endogen's senior financial officer has been its controller.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
